# Release-archive exclusions (second line of defence after .gitignore).
# `git archive` / GitHub "Download ZIP" honours export-ignore even if a file
# was ever force-added. Wildcards avoid quoting paths that contain spaces.
# The license/provenance documentation files are deliberately NOT excluded.

# User-supplied, rights-unverified media
Assets/audio/                 export-ignore
Assets/Background*/           export-ignore
Assets/Quran*/                export-ignore
Assets/fonts/                 export-ignore
Assets/*.png                  export-ignore
Assets/*.jpg                  export-ignore
Assets/*.jpeg                 export-ignore
Assets/*.webp                 export-ignore
Assets/*.svg                  export-ignore
Assets/*.ico                  export-ignore

# Generated state and user data
Draft/                        export-ignore
Output/                       export-ignore
.qvs_cache/                   export-ignore

# Local-only development artefacts
.backups/                     export-ignore
.backup-before-audio-player/  export-ignore
tests/.chrome-profile/        export-ignore
tests/.sandbox/               export-ignore
tests/draft-baseline/         export-ignore
tests/logs/                   export-ignore
tests/screenshots/            export-ignore
*.log                         export-ignore
HANDOFF.md                    export-ignore
PHASE1_REPORT.md              export-ignore
